1642-Example CI job:
1643-
1644-```bash
1645-set -euo pipefail
1646-
1647-./tests/validate-policy.sh profiles
1648-
1649:for unit in systemd/*.service systemd/*/*.conf; do
1650-    [[ -e "$unit" ]] || continue
1651:    systemd-analyze verify "$unit"
1652-done
1653-
1654-dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b
1655-```
1656-
1657-An integration runner should additionally execute:
1658-
1659-```bash
1660:sudo systemctl start apparmor
1661:sudo apparmor_parser -r /etc/apparmor.d/organization.acme-api
1662-sudo aa-enforce organization.acme-api
1663-sudo systemctl restart acme-api.service
