1676-```text
1677-Loaded profile count
1678-Profiles in complain mode
1679-Unconfined target processes
1680:Denials by profile and operation
1681-New denied paths after package upgrades
1682-Repeated denials that indicate a broken feature
1683-Unexpectedly successful negative tests
1684-App startup and request latency
1685-GPU software-fallback rate
1686-CUDA initialization failures
